","Wheat"],"image":"assets/recipes/07.webp","status":"published","version":1,"notes":"Quantities refer to the ingredient state listed. Nutrition is estimated from ingredient references; brands and cooking yields vary. The photograph is a serving suggestion.","notes_ar":"الأوزان حسب حالة المكون الموضحة. القيم الغذائية تقديرية وتختلف باختلاف المنتجات والطهي. الصورة اقتراح للتقديم.","source":"Panda Kitchen · estimated ingredient values","created_at":"2026-09-13","updated_at":"2026-09-13"}'::jsonb) on conflict(kind,id) do nothing;
insert into public.panda_records(kind,id,data) values('recipes','recipe_08','{"id":"recipe_08","name":"Apple cinnamon baked oats","name_ar":"شوفان مخبوز بالتفاح والقرفة","category":"Breakfast","minutes":35,"wait_minutes":0,"servings":1,"summary":"A simple start, with clear portions and everyday ingredients.","summary_ar":"بداية بسيطة بمقادير واضحة ومكونات يومية.","ingredients":[{"id":"oats","name":"Rolled oats · dry","name_ar":"شوفان ملفوف · جاف","protein":13,"carbs":60,"fat":7,"fiber":10,"allergens":"Gluten","unit":"g","quantity":50},{"id":"apple","name":"Apple · core removed","name_ar":"تفاح دون البذور","protein":0.3,"carbs":11.5,"fat":0.2,"fiber":2.4,"allergens":"","unit":"g","quantity":120},{"id":"milk","name":"Milk · 1.5% fat","name_ar":"حليب قليل الدسم","protein":3.5,"carbs":5,"fat":1.5,"fiber":0,"allergens":"Milk","unit":"g","quantity":100},{"id":"egg","name":"Whole egg · shell removed","name_ar":"بيض كامل دون القشرة","protein":12.6,"carbs":0.7,"fat":9.5,"fiber":0,"allergens":"Egg","unit":"g","quantity":50},{"id":"yogurt","name":"Greek yogurt · plain, 0% fat","name_ar":"زبادي يوناني سادة خالي الدسم","protein":10,"carbs":4,"fat":0.4,"fiber":0,"allergens":"Milk","unit":"g","quantity":100},{"id":"cinnamon","name":"Cinnamon · ground","name_ar":"قرفة مطحونة","protein":4,"carbs":28,"fat":1,"fiber":53,"allergens":"","unit":"g","quantity":2}],"steps":["Heat the oven to 180°C. Mix oats, milk, egg and cinnamon in a small baking dish.","Fold in half the chopped apple and arrange the remaining slices on top. Bake 25–30 minutes until set.","Rest for 5 minutes and serve with the yogurt."],"steps_ar":["سخن الفرن إلى ١٨٠°م واخلط الشوفان والحليب والبيض والقرفة في طبق فرن صغير.","أضف نصف التفاح المقطع ورتب بقية الشرائح فوقه واخبز ٢٥–٣٠ دقيقة حتى يتماسك.","اتركه ٥ دقائق وقدمه مع الزبادي."],"tags":["Vegetarian"],"allergens":["Egg","Gluten","Milk"],"image":"assets/recipes/08.webp","status":"published","version":1,"notes":"Quantities refer to the ingredient state listed. Nutrition is estimated from ingredient references; brands and cooking yields vary. The photograph is a serving suggestion.","notes_ar":"الأوزان حسب حالة المكون الموضحة. القيم الغذائية تقديرية وتختلف باختلاف المنتجات والطهي. الصورة اقتراح للتقديم.","source":"Panda Kitchen · estimated ingredient values","created_at":"2026-09-13","updated_at":"2026-09-13"}'::jsonb) on conflict(kind,id) do nothing;
insert into public.panda_records(kind,id,data) values('recipes','recipe_09','{"id":"recipe_09","name":"Chicken rice and broccoli","name_ar":"دجاج مع الأرز والبروكلي","category":"Main meals","minutes":30,"wait_minutes":0,"servings":1,"summary":"A complete, practical plate for your weekly meal plan.","summary_ar":"وجبة متكاملة وعملية ضمن خطة طعامك الأسبوعية.","ingredients":[{"id":"chicken","name":"Chicken breast · raw, skinless","name_ar":"صدر دجاج نيئ دون الجلد","protein":23,"carbs":0,"fat":2,"fiber":0,"allergens":"","unit":"g","quantity":180},{"id":"rice","name":"Basmati rice · dry","name_ar":"أرز بسمتي جاف","protein":7.5,"carbs":78,"fat":0.7,"fiber":1.2,"allergens":"","unit":"g","quantity":65},{"id":"broccoli","name":"Broccoli · raw","name_ar":"بروكلي نيئ","protein":2.8,"carbs":4,"fat":0.4,"fiber":2.6,"allergens":"","unit":"g","quantity":180},{"id":"oil","name":"Olive oil","name_ar":"زيت زيتون","protein":0,"carbs":0,"fat":100,"fiber":0,"allergens":"","unit":"g","quantity":7},{"id":"spice","name":"Ground spice mix · unsalted","name_ar":"بهارات مطحونة دون ملح","protein":10,"carbs":35,"fat":10,"fiber":20,"allergens":"Check blend","unit":"g","quantity":2}],"steps":["Cook the dry rice according to its packet. Cut the broccoli into florets.","Coat the chicken with oil and spices. Pan-cook over medium heat, turning, until its centre reaches 74°C.","Steam the broccoli until tender-crisp. Rest and slice the chicken, then serve with rice."],"steps_ar":["اطه الأرز الجاف وفق العبوة وقطع البروكلي إلى زهرات.","غط الدجاج بالزيت والبهارات واطهه مع التقليب حتى تصل حرارته الداخلية إلى ٧٤°م.","اطه البروكلي بالبخار ثم أرح الدجاج وقطعه وقدمه مع الأرز."],"tags":["Meal prep"],"allergens":["Check blend"],"image":"assets/recipes/09.webp","status":"published","version":1,"notes":"Quantities refer to the ingredient state listed. Nutrition is estimated from ingredient references; brands and cooking yields vary. The photograph is a serving suggestion.","notes_ar":"الأوزان حسب حالة المكون الموض